msgid ""
"[*cols*][**+a**][**+r**]. Suppress output for records whose *z*-value equals "
"NaN [Default outputs all records]. Optionally, supply a comma-separated list "
"of all columns or column ranges to consider for this NaN test [Default only "
"considers the third data column (i.e., *cols = 2*)]. Column ranges must be "
"given in the format *start*\\ [:*inc*]:*stop*, where *inc* defaults to 1 if "
"not specified. The following modifiers are supported:  - **+r** to reverse "
"the suppression, i.e., only output the   records whose *z*-value equals NaN. "
"- **+a** to suppress the output of the record if just one or   more of the "
"columns equal NaN [Default skips record only   if values in all specified "
"*cols* equal NaN]."
